Release Date: 	2/24/2017
SVN Revision #:	9782
Agency:		FHL/FNM
Data Level:	Pool
Periods:	All
Data Field:	Incentive 2.00 / Burnout 2.30 / 2.40

Update:
1. Incentive Bug Fix
	- The algorithm will check if the pool has loan level information for every factor date. If it does, it will use the loan level aggregate value, otherwise, use the pool level value.  So it will cover the case that we only have one snapshot of loan level data and the won't overwrite the loan level average numbers.
2. Updated burnout 2.30 and 2.40 due to incentive update

